                                "sense_id": "6476f069-d359-398c-9f1f-fed180c97c02",
                                "text": "He sulks and schemes. And Russia, in its wretched boom, sulks with him. \"Let us be certain: the cold war was won by one side and lost by another.\" This epic collapse is continuing, we sense, inside the circus tent of smutty new money that Misha has. Shteyngart is a master panoramist who paints in just three tones: exhausted grays, despairing browns and superficial golds."
